<title>USA: Calprop delisted from Amer Stock Exchange.</title>
<headline>Calprop delisted from Amer Stock Exchange.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calprop Corp said it was delisted from the American Stock Exchange after having its appeal of an earlier delisting decision denied.</p>
<p>It said its shares will be quoted in the pink sheets for about 30 days while processing for trading on the NASD's Bulletin Board is completed.</p>
